When the title of “Royal Cupid” is mistakenly given to you, a normal mortal, the kingdom’s matchmaking troubles are thrust upon your shoulders. Wars or alliances, enemies or lovers, so much can arise from one well- or un-planned date!
This is a point-and-click game with visual novel elements, playable on the web at https://the-cove.itch.io/kingdom-sweethearts.

The game is set in a fantasy medieval period, where magic and technology exist alongside each other. Though the story isn't there yet, the reason the player is mistaken as Cupid is partly due o their elf ears. 
Gameplay mainly consists of reading the scrolls/the book, learning about the nobles + territories, buying items for the matchmaking, handing them over, and then watching the fruits of your labour.


Built in Godot game engine with GDScript. Music made with virtual instruments in Bandlab. Fonts and sound effects were found free online. 
